       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "In today's update we bring you",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The \"SKELETON KING\" Halloween themed boss, and his army of skeletons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2x XP during this spooky period, which will last for 3 weeks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We have also made several improvements and fixes including",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Better baked lighting on all maps",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievements bug fixed so they can now be unlocked as usual: Happy Halloween!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
